end="59.128" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="35.802" end="38.827" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.802" end="36.980">我不介意阳光</span><span begin="36.980" end="37.989">透一些</span><span begin="37.989" end="38.490">尘</span><span begin="38.490" end="38.827">埃</span></p><p begin="39.023" end="41.945" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.023" end="39.928">就当作你有</span><span begin="39.928" end="40.706">难说</span><span begin="40.706" end="41.074">的</span><span begin="41.074" end="41.479">无</span><span begin="41.479" end="41.945">奈</span></p><p begin="42.173" end="46.449" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.173" end="42.932">不好意思</span><span begin="42.932" end="45.207">有</span><span begin="45.207" end="45.556">感</span><span begin="45.556" end="46.449">慨</span></p><p begin="47.781" end="50.892" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.781" end="48.927">可是你一笑得</span><span begin="48.927" end="49.737">无害</span><span begin="49.737" end="50.053">又</span><span begin="50.053" end="50.457">无</span><span begin="50.457" end="50.892">赖</span></p><p begin="51.017" end="53.998" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.017" end="51.934">我明明还算</span><span begin="51.934" end="52.717">清楚</span><span begin="52.717" end="53.091">的</span><span begin="53.091" end="53.454">脑</span><span begin="53.454" end="53.998">袋</span></p><p begin="54.184" end="59.128" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.184" end="54.615">又</span><span begin="54.615" end="55.368">在</span><span begin="55.658" end="56.439">瞒天过海</span> <span begin="56.439" end="57.570">忍不住</span><span begin="57.570" end="58.360">想一些未</span><span begin="58.360" end="59.128">来</span></p></div><div begin="59.988" end="1:23.526" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="59.988" end="1:02.876" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.988" end="1:00.991">我想你还是</span><span begin="1:00.991" end="1:01.637">不</span><span begin="1:01.637" end="1:02.415">明</span><span begin="1:02.415" end="1:02.876